{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And he became an archer.</b> He would shoot and cast arrows with his bow — and it resembles ורבו. And some explain: רובה in the sense of child, as it is translated רביא. And likewise יקבלו הרובין תשובתן in tractate חולין, and the meaning is: and the child became an archer, a master of the bow."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:05:44.657109034Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}